## ProjectModel and ProjectViewModel

**Namespace:** `Cyrena.Dotnet.Models`
**Assembly:** `Cyrena.Dotnet`

### ProjectModel

```csharp
public class ProjectModel : IJsonSerializable
{
    public ProjectModel();
    public string Id { get; set; } = default!;
    public string ConversationId { get; set; } = default!;
    public string ProjectFilePath { get; set; } = default!;
    public string? ProjectName { get; set; }
    public string ProjectDirectory { get; set; } = default!;
    public string? ProjectTypeId { get; set; }
    public string? ProjectTypeName { get; set; }
    public Dictionary<string, string?> Properties { get; set; }
    public string? this[string key] { get; set; }
    public DevelopPlan? Plan { get; set; }
    public string ToJson();
}
```

### ProjectViewModel (AI-simplified)

```csharp
public class ProjectViewModel : IJsonSerializable
{
    public ProjectViewModel(ProjectModel model);
    public string Id { get; set; } = default!;
    public string? ProjectName { get; set; }
    public string? ProjectTypeName { get; set; }
    public string? TargetFrameworks { get; set; }
    public string? RootNamespace { get; set; }
}
```

### Key Properties
- `Properties` dictionary stores parsed project info (namespace, target frameworks, etc.)
- `Plan` is the `DevelopPlan` for this project (null if not yet indexed)
- `ProjectTypeId` matches `IDotnetProjectType.Id`

